{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119714","id":4512486864,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDPcV0A","number":119714,"title":"The height (offset to the ground) of a navigationMesh in 3D depends on the thickness of the collision shape undeneath.","user":{"login":"MockingSpark","id":27427497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI3NDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27427497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark","html_url":"https://github.com/MockingSpark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MockingSpark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-05-24T18:07:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T07:57:53Z","closed_at":"2026-08-09T07:57:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Bug found in 4.6.2.stable, reproductible in v4.7.beta3.official [860821708]\n\n### System information\n\n system : Godot v4.7.beta3 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.95 Gio memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Surround 7.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe height (offset to the ground) of a navigationMesh in 3D depends on the thickness of the collision shape undeneath.\n\nI'd want them to be consistent in their offset given the same parameters.\n\n<img width=\"908\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0a33f62-8b19-4d91-8e38-4c8d44441feb\" />\n\n<img width=\"790\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70b76b23-a254-4406-bb27-f0ebb99ba2ab\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\non a new project, create a new scene.\nAdd a navigationRegion3D node\nAdd a navigationMesh to the navigationRegion3D\nAdd a staticBody3D node child of the navigationRegion3D\nAdd a collisionShape3D child of the staticBody3D\nAdd a boxShape3D shape to the collisionShape3D\nIncrease the size on the boxShape3D to 4, 1, 4\nBake the navigationMesh\nchange the size of the boxShape3D to 4, 0.2, 4\nBake the navigationMesh\n\nThe offset to the ground is different on both bakes\n\n<img width=\"358\" height=\"169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6f13f8d-c6f6-4c75-bad5-5ce8be3efdc8\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe MRP : [issue-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28196826/issue-test.zip)\n\nPlay with the bottom handle of the navigationShape3D and bake the NavigationMesh to see the offset change.","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}